<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>TaskAPI</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>TaskAPI</h1>
  <p>A minimal task management REST API.</p>
  <h2>Routes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>GET /tasks — list public tasks</li>
    <li>POST /tasks — create a task</li>
    <li>GET /admin/tasks — admin task list (requires X-Admin-Key header)</li>
    <li>GET /debug/env — environment info</li>
  </ul>
</body>
</html>
